│                          │ ring-based implementation with the coordinate-wise linear-program refinement idea from    │
│                          │ the stronger prior optimization script.                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The configuration is represented inside a fixed reference triangle of area 1/2. Because   │
│                          │ the normalized objective is affine invariant, this does not restrict solution quality     │
│                          │ while avoiding repeated convex-hull computations. The three reference vertices remain     │
│                          │ fixed, all other points are projected into the triangle, and the normalized minimum       │
│                          │ triangle area is exactly the minimum absolute determinant.                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ A short deterministic annealing phase discovers useful orientation/sign patterns,         │
│                          │ focusing most moves on points involved in the current bottleneck triangle. Each promising │
│                          │ solution is then polished by alternating linear programs that maximize the minimum signed │
│                          │ determinant while holding the complementary coordinate fixed. This gives substantially    │
│                          │ faster local improvement than pure annealing and retains a deterministic NumPy-only       │
│                          │ fallback if SciPy is unavailable.                                                         │
