│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ coordinate_feasibility_pump                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ This implementation replaces expensive simulated annealing with a deterministic           │
│                          │ coordinate-wise feasibility pump. The containing region is a fixed unit-area right        │
│                          │ triangle, so normalized minimum triangle area is invariant and can be optimized directly. │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ For each movable point, all triangle-area constraints involving that point become linear  │
│                          │ half-plane constraints when the other twelve points are fixed. The algorithm therefore    │
│                          │ performs repeated maximin coordinate updates: it binary-searches the greatest feasible    │
│                          │ minimum determinant and intersects the corresponding half-planes with the containing      │
│                          │ triangle. This raises bottleneck triangles directly rather than relying on stochastic     │
│                          │ acceptance of random perturbations.                                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Multiple deterministic randomized simplex initializations explore distinct orientation    │
│                          │ chambers, while feasibility-based local refinement is substantially faster than           │
│                          │ repeatedly recomputing convex hulls during annealing. A final scale converts the          │
│                          │ reference triangle to exactly unit area.                                                  │
