│                          │ threefold structure. The existing restarts differ only by small radial and phase noise,   │
│                          │ so they tend to enter the same hull/sign basin. This edit cycles among: the original      │
│                          │ symmetric rings, a mildly elliptical affine embedding, and independently perturbed        │
│                          │ angular/radial ring roles. The latter permits radial exchanges between nearby rings and   │
│                          │ changes hull/interior combinatorics before annealing. Survivor selection is also made     │
│                          │ family-diverse: the best trajectory from each prior family is guaranteed a long           │
